        "valueString": "No fevers, rigors, or systemic unwellness; no abnormal vaginal discharge; no acute severe unilateral pain or shoulder-tip pain; no dysuria, urinary frequency, or flank pain; no nausea, vomiting, anorexia, night sweats, or weight loss."
